  <div class="prose">
    <p>PAYMENTS INNOVATION CONSULTING is a specialised consultancy focusing on regulation and technology-driven digital finance innovations, in particular Payments, FinTech, Digital and Tokenised Money (Stablecoins, Deposit Tokens, CBDC/Digital Euro) and Open Finance.</p>

    <p>We work together with all stakeholders in the domain, including central banks, regulators and supervisors, the transaction processing, digital transformation and strategy teams of commercial banks and neo-banks, global consultancies, third parties, associations, solution providers, payment processors, card organisations, corporates and merchants. To these we offer services of Business Consultancy, Market Research and Training.</p>

    <p>Our special expertise is Payment-related innovations such as Digital Finance, Open Finance, European legislation (PSD2/PSD3/PSR, Instant Payments Regulation, MiCAR, FiDA, DORA, EUDIW/eIDAS 2, AI Act, AMLR, GDPR), FinTech, e-Wallets, Digital Identity, Digital and Tokenised Money, B2B/SCF/eInvoicing, Transaction Strategy and more general areas such as policy/legislation and innovation management.</p>

    <p>Our highly bespoke services - consistently 5* rated - are by personal introduction only but if you would like more information we look forward to hearing from you.</p>

